{
 "about": "Pine Hollow's hero props (PINE-HOLLOW-REMASTER PH-B3, art/pine-hollow/round-8-assets): TRELLIS.2 generations -> photoreal PBR game props (--keep-texture: smooth-shaded, the generated texture baked ungraded + a normal map from the high mesh). Each ref builds three assets: <ref> (LOD0, 1024^2, desktop), <ref>-phone (the same mesh at 512^2: moved to <ref>/<ref>.phone.glb, which tierUrl serves the phone) and <ref>-lod1 (a quarter of the triangles, 256^2). Built with: python3 scripts/img2mesh/build_props.py scripts/img2mesh/props/pine-hollow-hero.json public/assets/models/pine-hollow-hero, then scripts/img2mesh/pine_hollow_phone.sh.",
